      },
      "function": "other",
      "text": {
        "jp": "<TLP>調査記録：１４４９年２月２２日\n「異教徒の洞窟」の最深部へたどり着いた\n我々の目の前に異質な物体が現れた。\nそれは、不思議な扉だった。",
        "official_en": "<TLP>Investigation Log: Febrai 22, 1449\nUpon reaching the deepest part of \"Heretics' Cave,\" we were stunned\nwhen a strange object appeared before our very eyes. A door.",
        "real_en": "<TLP>Investigation Log: Febrai 22, 1449\nUpon reaching the deepest part of \"Heathens' Cave,\" we were stunned\nwhen a strange object appeared before our very eyes. A door."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
