      },
      "function": "other",
      "text": {
        "jp": "<TLP>扉の表面には古代文字と思しき字で\n何かが書かれているが、劣化が激しく\n薄暗い洞窟の中では、残念ながら、\n意味までは判読することはできなかった。",
        "official_en": "<TLP>We immediately took note of the odd writings on its surface. It was\nclear that the etchings were of some ancient language, but with the\ncave's darkness and the door's deterioration, it was impossible to\ndecipher its meaning.",
        "real_en": null
      },
