        "branch_phase": null,
        "authored_group": "MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_m02"
      },
      "function": "other",
      "text": {
        "jp": "<TLP>雷を帯びた人物は強く、仲間たちは抵抗も空しく\nなすすべもなく斬り倒されていった。\n私は恐怖のあまり、仲間を見捨てて逃げ出したが、\n道に迷い、無事に出られる自信はない……",
        "official_en": "<TLP>They were strong, far stronger than us. And before I knew it, my\ncompanions had been cut down one after another. I was going to be\nnext. I was terrified, so I abandoned them. I ran. But now I'm lost, and\nI can't remember which way I came from... I'm not making it out\nof here, am I?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
