      "function": "other",
      "text": {
        "jp": "<TLP>調査記録：１４４９年２月２５日\n食べる物も食べず、迷いながら逃亡を続けたが\nどうやら行き止まりに追い詰められてしまった。\n闇の向こうから、雷の人物が放つ燐光と\n忌まわしき足音とが近づいて来る。ここまでか……",
        "official_en": "<TLP>Investigation Log: Febrai 25, 1449\nIt's been days since I've eaten, and it seems I've hit yet another dead\nend. From beyond the darkness, I see their glow and hear their\nominous footsteps. Those lightning things are coming for me.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
